<title>USA: Tracor Inc issues $250 mln in 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Tracor Inc issues $250 mln in 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A issue from Tracor Inc was priced on Friday via BT Securities, according to a high-yield syndicate source.</p>
<p>The deal was increased to $250 million from an original size of $200 million according to a syndicate source.</p>
<p>BORROWER TRACOR INC</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 8.50 PCT   MATURITY 3/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 99.602  FIRST PAY DATE 9/1/1997 LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD 8.56 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD 200 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTE: THREE-YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 35 PERCENT AT 108.50. ((U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
